      "heading": "The silent -ent",
      "text": [
        "For {ils} and {elles}, the verb ends in -ent."
      ],
      "note": "The -ent is written but not spoken. In writing, it tells you that several people are doing something. It can change how the letters before it sound, so {ils veulent} sounds a little different from {il veut}.",
